OL,3,GNEWSATaxi licensing upgrades proposed
OL,4,Ato improve safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new taxi licensing policy aimed at
OL,7,Fstrengthening standards for passenger
OL,8,Fsafety in Peterborough is set to go out
OL,9,Fto public consultation later this
OL,10,Fmonth.
OL,12,FAt Thursday's meeting, members of
OL,13,FPeterborough City Council's Licensing
OL,14,FCommittee approved plans for taxi users
OL,15,Fand operators to comment on a draft
OL,16,Ftaxi and private hire policy which
OL,17,Fwould introduce new measures to
OL,18,Foverhaul the trade.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
