OL,3,GNEWSATaxi licensing upgrades proposed
OL,4,Ato improve safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe review comes as the authority's
OL,7,Fcurrent licensing policy nears expiry
OL,8,Fand follows national recommendations
OL,9,Ffor tighter regulation of the industry.
OL,11,FThe proposals include updated vehicle
OL,12,Ftesting requirements and additional
OL,13,Fsafeguarding measures to protect
OL,14,Fchildren and other vulnerable
OL,15,Fpassengers.
